      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־יְמִינִי</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo gentílico</strong> de <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנָימִן</span> <strong>1.</strong> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.21\">1Sm 9.21</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:1\" href=\"/Psalms.7.1\">Sl 7.1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־הַיְמִינִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:15\" href=\"/Judges.3.15\">Jz 3.15</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.11\">2Sm 16.11</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.17\">2Sm 19.17</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 2:8\" href=\"/I_Kings.2.8\">1Rs 2.8</a>; plural <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי יְמִינִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.7\">1Sm 22.7</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 19:16\" href=\"/Judges.19.16\">Jz 19.16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לַבֵּנ֯ יְמִינִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.12\">1Cr 27.12</a> (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">לַבֵּן יְמִינִי</span>); = <span dir=\"rtl\">יְמִינִי</span> (ver esse verbete) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:4\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.4\">1Sm 9.4</a> +.",
