      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִי</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  um dos heróis de Davi <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:36\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.36\">2Sm 23.36</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּנִי הַגָּדִי</span> (‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 11:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.11.38\">1Cr 11.38</a> tem <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּן־הַגְרִי</span>, mas ver Dr<sup>Sm</sup>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  levitas, <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.31\">1Cr 6.31</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:17\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.17\">Ne 3.17</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:7\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.7\">Ne 8.7</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנּוּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:10\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.10\">Ne 10.10</a>) <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.4\">Ne 9.4</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (repetido provavelmente por erro, cf. BeRy) versículo <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.5\">Ne 9.5</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:14\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.14\">Ne 10.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:22\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.22\">Ne 11.22</a>. Sobre <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:40\" href=\"/Ezra.2.40\">Ed 2.40</a> = <span data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:42\" data-bdbh-source-href=\"/Nehemiah.7.42\" data-bdbh-suspended=\"BIBLE_LABEL_TARGET_MISMATCH\">Ne 7.43 [destino digital: Ne 7.42; remissão suspensa]</span> cf. Gr<sup>Gesch. ii. 2, 389</sup>; ele lê <span dir=\"rtl\">קדמיאל בני</span> em lugar de <span dir=\"rtl\">קדמיאל לבני</span>, tomando <span dir=\"rtl\">בני</span> como nome próprio, como em 3 <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.5\">Ne 9.5</a> Καδμιηλου καὶ Βαννου.<br><strong>3.</strong>  um homem de Judá <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.4\">1Cr 9.4</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִן) בָּנִי</span> Qr (> Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">בנימן</span>).<br><strong>4.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:10\" href=\"/Ezra.2.10\">Ed 2.10</a> leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנּוּי</span> cf. ‖ <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.15\">Ne 7.15</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  chefes de famílias de Israel <strong>a.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:29\" href=\"/Ezra.10.29\">Ed 10.29</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.15\">Ne 10.15</a>; <strong>c.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:34\" href=\"/Ezra.10.34\">Ed 10.34</a> mas talvez se leia <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּנּוּי</span> ou <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּגְוַי</span> cf. acima<br><strong>6.</strong>  um israelita <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:38\" href=\"/Ezra.10.38\">Ed 10.38</a>.—<strong>(</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">בני</span> como nome próprio palmireno Vog<sup>No. 34</sup>.<strong>)</strong>",
