      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעַט</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo: dar coice (</strong>assim hebraico novo, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעַט</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܥܰܛ</span> <strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּבְעַט</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.15\">Dt 32.15</a>; 2.ª pessoa masculina plural <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּבְעֲטוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.29\">1Sm 2.29</a>;—<em>dar coice</em> (somente figurado, de Israel refratário) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.15\">Dt 32.15</a> (absoluto); <em>dar coice contra</em> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>) <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:29\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.29\">1Sm 2.29</a>.",
