      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעַל</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: casar-se, dominar (</strong>cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بَعَلَ</span> = <em>ter como propriedade, possuir</em>, especialmente uma esposa ou concubina; etiópico ብዕለ <em>ser rico</em>, assírio <em>bâlu</em>, <em>dominar</em> COT<sup>Gloss.</sup>, aramaico <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעַל</span> <em>tomar posse de esposa</em> ou <em>concubina</em><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:11\" href=\"/Malachi.2.11\">Ml 2.11</a> + 6 vezes; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יִבְעַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.5\">Is 62.5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; particípio com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">בֹּעֲלַיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.5\">Is 54.5</a>; passivo feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעוּלָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.1\">Is 54.1</a> + 3 vezes;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>casar-se com</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:3\" href=\"/Genesis.20.3\">Gn 20.3</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.13\">Dt 21.13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.22\">Dt 22.22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 24:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.24.1\">Dt 24.1</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.1\">Is 54.1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.5\">Is 54.5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.4\">Is 62.4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.5\">Is 62.5</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Malachi 2:11\" href=\"/Malachi.2.11\">Ml 2.11</a>; seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.14\">Jr 3.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.32\">Jr 31.32</a> <em>ser senhor</em> (<em>marido</em>) <em>de</em>. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.14\">Jr 3.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.32\">Jr 31.32</a> AW JosKi Thes, comparando o árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">بَعَلَ</span> <em>sentir repugnância</em>, derivam de II. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעַל</span> <strong>aborrecer</strong> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span>); assim Buhl: Gie Du Co em <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.32\">Jr 31.32</a> leem <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּעַלְתִּי</span> (tratando <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.14\">Jr 3.14</a> como I. <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּעַל</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>dominar sobre</em> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:22\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.22\">1Cr 4.22</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.13\">Is 26.13</a>.<br><strong>Nifal</strong>  imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּבָּעֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.23\">Pv 30.23</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.4\">Is 62.4</a> <em>ser desposada</em>.",
